meiotic recombination, targeted gene expression, whole transcriptome and ontology analyses as well as ToxCast data mining all indicate that these effects are partly achieved via mechanisms distinct from BPAs. These findings therefore raise new concerns about the safety of BPA alternatives and the risk associated with human exposure to mixtures.","author_count":9,"author_ids":["A5013476326","A5030992305","A5038441548","A5042856509","A5062835705","A5088751229","A5090730019","A5101438449"],"author_institution_ids":["I161318765"],"authors":[{"id":"A5101438449","name":"Yichang Chen"},{"id":"A5013476326","name":"Le Shu"},{"id":"A5038441548","name":"Zhiqun Qiu"},{"id":"","name":"Dong Yeon Lee"},{"id":"A5030992305","name":"Sara J. Settle"},{"id":"A5042856509","name":"Shane S. Que Hee"},{"id":"A5090730019","name":"Donatello Telesca"},{"id":"A5088751229","name":"Xia Yang"},{"id":"A5062835705","name":"Patrick Allard"}],"ca_any_author":true,"ca_led":true,"cited_by_count":105,"doi":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pgen.1006223","domain_tags":["human_exposure_and_health_risk","plastic_associated_chemicals"],"facet_tags":["matrix:food_and_drink"],"institution_ids":["I161318765"],"is_oa":true,"journal":"PLoS Genetics","last_updated":"2026-11-10T11:39:43.021295","license":"cc-by","needs_review":false,"oa_status":"gold","oa_url":"https://journals.plos.org/plosgenetics/article/file?id=10.1371/journal.pgen.1006223&type=printable","openalex_topics":["T10269","T10686","T11505"],"plastic_related":true,"plastic_tier":"chemicals-in-plastics","primary_topic":"T10686","pub_date":"2016-07-29","study_type":"article","title":"Exposure to the BPA-Substitute Bisphenol S Causes Unique Alterations of Germline Function","type":"article","work_id":"W2498253482","year":2016}]}
